        Me0wzz-NKS kernel for Samsung Galaxy J5 (2016)

This kernel supports J510F/N TouchWiz custom ROMs on the Korean
SM-J510S/K/L variants running Android 6.0.1 (Marshmallow).

FEATURES:

 - F2FS (Flash-Friendly File System).
 - Prima WLAN driver.
 - Faux Sound Control.
 - SELinux permissive mode.

BUILDING AND INSTALLING:

 - Build zImage and combine it with the ramdisk.

 - Replace the required library files in /system/lib.

 - Disable ro.support.securestorage in build.prop for WLAN and
   Bluetooth support.

